263	     * Emits the immutable structured {@code OWNER_CREATED} event to the {@link #AUDIT} logger as a
264	     * compact JSON object, alongside the human-readable audit line. The event's {@code seq} is drawn
265	     * from the process-wide {@link #AUDIT_SEQUENCE}, so it strictly increases across creates, and it
266	     * carries both the owner's id and its current primary identifier via
267	     * {@link #primaryIdentifier(Owner)}.
